# As Thick as Thieves (windurst 70): the three goblins' dice games in Dangruf Wadi. Accepted by GM (a THF at level 50,
# The Tenshodo Showdown completed by GM). Each game draws rand1, rand2 (math.randomInt(1, 999)): rand1 > rand2 wins (the
# win event: Regal Die, 0, rand1, rand2), else the loss event (0, 0, rand1, rand2); YOU_PLACE_ITEM (0, the item) first
# either way. The pinned seed picks each game's side; the flow sets Prog (and failedGame at Saltvix) by GM before each
# game, and the options are chosen from the recorded sides so that every win and loss event (136 / 142 / 137 / 138 and
# 139 / 145 / 140 / 141) is finished with each of its three options. Every finish confirms the trade (the item taken).
# Win finishes: option 0: failedGame 0 (136 / 142 only), YOU_BEAT_GOBLIN, Prog + 1; option 2: failedGame 1 (136 / 142
# only), YOU_GAVE_UP; option 1: nothing more. Loss finishes: failedGame 1 (139 / 145 only); option 1 GOBLIN_BEAT_YOU,
# option 2 YOU_GAVE_UP, option 0 nothing more.
# Out of turn first: qm3 a bone chip, the salt plus a chip: nil; qm3 at Prog 0: nil; qm4 at Prog 1 (DONT_WASTE_TIME),
# the grass plus a chip: nil; qm5 at Prog 1 (JUST_WONT_DO), the egg plus a chip: nil; qm3 at Prog 2 (BEAT_SALTVIX,
# returns nil); qm4 at Prog 3 (BEAT_GRASSWIX); qm5 at Prog 4 (BEAT_EGGBLIX); a bone chip to qm4 and qm5: nil. After the
# games: qm3 the salt plus a chip at Prog 1: nil; qm5 at Prog 2: JUST_WONT_DO.
lists DangrufWadi/qm3/onTrade DangrufWadi/qm4/onTrade DangrufWadi/qm5/onTrade DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/136 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/137 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/138 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/139 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/140 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/141 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/142 DangrufWadi/onEventFinish/145
char zone=DangrufWadi pos=-365.9,3.0,229.0 job=THF lvl=50
quest Windurst.TheTenshodoShowdown completed
quest Windurst.AsThickAsThieves accepted
item BoneChip x3
item ChunkOfRockSalt x12
item ChunkOfRockSalt x6
item ClumpOfGausebitWildgrass x10
item LizardEgg x11
login
trade qm3 BoneChip x1                          # not the salt: nil
trade qm3 ChunkOfRockSalt x1 BoneChip x1       # the salt plus an extra: nil
trade qm3 ChunkOfRockSalt x1                   # Prog 0: nil (not 1, not > 1)
charvar Quest[2][70]Prog 1                     # GM
walk -373.9,-2.22,445.0
trade qm4 ClumpOfGausebitWildgrass x1          # Prog 1: DONT_WASTE_TIME
trade qm4 ClumpOfGausebitWildgrass x1 BoneChip x1 # plus an extra: nil
trade qm4 BoneChip x1                          # not the grass: nil
walk -460.9,2.456,-141.2
trade qm5 LizardEgg x1                         # Prog 1: JUST_WONT_DO
trade qm5 LizardEgg x1 BoneChip x1             # plus an extra: nil
trade qm5 BoneChip x1                          # not the egg: nil
charvar Quest[2][70]Prog 2                     # GM
walk -365.9,3.0,229.0
trade qm3 ChunkOfRockSalt x1                   # Prog 2: BEAT_SALTVIX (sent, not returned): nil
charvar Quest[2][70]Prog 3                     # GM
walk -373.9,-2.22,445.0
trade qm4 ClumpOfGausebitWildgrass x1          # Prog 3: BEAT_GRASSWIX
charvar Quest[2][70]Prog 4                     # GM
walk -460.9,2.456,-141.2
trade qm5 LizardEgg x1                         # Prog 4: BEAT_EGGBLIX
walk -365.9,3.0,229.0
charvar Quest[2][70]Prog 1                     # GM: game 1
charvar Quest[2][70]failedGame 0               # GM
